repository-code: "https://github.com/SCLW/Crackle-Circuit"
url: "https://github.com/SCLW/Crackle-Circuit"
abstract: >
  Discrete-transistor recreation of Michel Waisvisz's Cracklebox,
  replacing the obsolete LM709 op-amp with an equivalent built from
  individual transistors and resistors. Includes EAGLE schematic and
  board files, Gerber output, and a full bill of materials.
